    v3=boxes('Target: recover water from saltwater',['Salt solution','Water evaporates;\nsalt remains','Vapour cools\nand condenses'],'Capture the vapour and collect the liquid water.\nProcess schematic only; not an apparatus-building guide.')
    ev=[('A • Sand + water','Target: collect the sand. Sand is insoluble in water and its grains can be trapped by ordinary filter paper.'),('B • Salt + water','Target: collect the dissolved salt. Salt solution passes through ordinary filter paper. Removing water can leave salt behind.'),('C • Salt + water','Target: collect the water. Letting it escape into room air does not collect it. Capture its vapour and cool it to liquid.'),('D • Sand + salt + water','Target: collect sand and salt separately. Sand is insoluble; salt is dissolved. Different components need a sequence of processes.'),('Process choices','Filter: retain insoluble solid. Evaporate: leave dissolved solid. Capture vapour and condense: collect solvent as liquid. Methods are models, not instructions to improvise heating.'),('Limits','No tasting or drinking. A method’s name does not prove complete recovery or safe drinking water; other contaminants and losses may be present.')]
